# the typed patterns become their characters in a name and a comment body, not in
# an action; a text set by edit-text stays as written (EDIT-AUTO-2/3/5)
edit n0 title
select-all
type On -- off
commit
edit n2 body
select-all
type (c) <<note>> a -> b...
commit
new-action n1 entry/ x()
edit n1 action 0
type y-- >> 1
commit
edit-text n1 title set -- as written
